OL,3,GNEWSAFarm for underprivileged children
OL,4,Aopens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farm which offers residential and day
OL,7,Ftrips for underprivileged children is
OL,8,Fgiving members of the public a rare
OL,9,Fopportunity to visit.
OL,11,FDodford Children's Farm in Bromsgrove,
OL,12,FWorcestershire, will open its doors on
OL,13,F15 and 16 September for Heritage Open
OL,14,FDays, an annual national festival of
OL,15,Fhistory and culture.
OL,17,FThe theme for this year's event is
OL,18,FEveryday Histories, exploring the
OL,19,F"often-overlooked stories of ordinary
OL,20,Fworking people and their daily lives".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
